# DS3005: `when` is a `datetime` in one file and a `string` in the other, and there is no
# common type. The error names both files and the column.
mode: check
---- query
from '../../data/conflict/*.csv' | take 1
---- expected
error[DS3005]: the files matched by `../../data/conflict/*.csv` disagree on the type of `when`
  --> query:1:6
  |
1 | from '../../data/conflict/*.csv' | take 1
  |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ column `when` cannot be merged
  |
  = help: read the files separately, convert the column to one type, and combine them with `union`
  = note: `when` is `datetime` in `../../data/conflict/a.csv`
  = note: `when` is `string` in `../../data/conflict/b.csv`
